{"type": "message", "id": "ad22e9b0-901d-48e0-90ee-082aa9cb9feb", "parentId": "e17c9e36-90f5-4a32-b9f6-ad0e67927ca1", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T08:14:05.150Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call1b39d34f98ca4691a66dd5f2d6a56aee", "toolName": "read", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"名次矩阵配平与校验（排序制评分：每个维度列 1..N 各用一次、无并列）。\n\n用法（原样可执行）:\n  python3 rank_matrix.py solve --in <输入json> --out <输出csv路径>\n  python3 rank_matrix.py verify --in <矩阵csv>\n\nsolve 输入 json 形状:\n  {\"projects\":[{\"name\":\"甲\"},{\"name\":\"乙\"}],          # N>=2 个项目\n   \"dimensions\":[\"匹配度\",\"校企\"],                     # K>=1 个维度\n   \"target_order\":[\"甲\",\"乙\"],                        # 综合推荐顺序（最优在前）\n   \"prior\":{\"甲\":{\"匹配度\":1}}}                      # 可选：已有名次草稿，求解尽量贴近\n\nsolve 行为: 确定性局部搜索（逐维交换名次），目标=先满足综合顺序与名次合计严格递增，\n再最小化与 prior 的偏差；无 prior 时从\"名次=目标位置\"出发。输出:\n  <out>.csv  表头 项目,<各维度>,合计，按合计升序（=target_order）\n  <out>.json {\"n\",\"dimensions\",\"order\",\"sums\",\"verified\"}\nstdout 同步打印该 json。退出码: 0 成功; 2 用法错误; 3 输入不合法; 4 未找到满足约束的解。\n\nverify 行为: 校验每列是否恰为 1..N 的排列（无重复无缺号），并给出合计与隐含顺序；\nstdout 打印 {\"verified\":true,...}；违规时 exit 3，stderr 说明具体列与违规值。\n\"\"\"\nimport argparse\nimport csv\nimport json\nimport sys\n\n\ndef load_solve_input(path):\n    with open(path, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        d = json.load(f)\n    names = [p[\"name\"] for p in d[\"projects\"]]\n    dims = list(d[\"dimensions\"])\n    order = list(d[\"target_order\"])\n    prior = d.get(\"prior\") or {}\n    if len(set(names)) != len(names) or not names:\n        raise ValueError(\"projects.name 必须非空且唯一\")\n    if sorted(order) != sorted(names):\n        raise ValueError(\"target_order 必须是全部项目名的排列\")\n    if not dims:\n        raise ValueError(\"dimensions 不能为空\")\n    return names, dims, order, prior\n\n\ndef is_order_ok(sums, order):\n    seq = sorted(sums, key=lambda n: sums[n])\n    vals = [sums[n] for n in order]\n    return seq == order and all(vals[i] <